guide forever/class/warlock/incubus-horde
title Succubus and Incubus (Horde)
category Class
class Warlock
folder Warlock
faction Horde
levels 20-28
zone Orgrimmar
keywords Summon Succubus, Summon Incubus, sayaad, Devourer of Souls, Blind Cazul, News of Dogran, Ken'zigla's Draught, Dogran's Captivity, Love's Gift, Hearts of the Pure, Love Hurts, Wish You Were Here, Hearts of the Lovers, The Binding, Gan'rul Bloodeye, Cazul, Zankaja, Gazrog, Ken'zigla, Malaka'jin, Grunt Logmar, Grunt Dogran, Dogran's Pendant, Magar, Krilge, Withered Scarf, Fallen Sky Lake, Carendin Halgar, Godrick Farsan, Dalin Forgewright, Corma Villard, Avelina Lilly, Isaac Pearson, Ambermill, Ratchet, Small Soul Pouch, Warlock, class pet
reward spell 712 "Summon Succubus"
reward spell 713 "Summon Incubus"
reward item 22243
why At 20: the succubus and Forever's incubus, its male twin, each with a soul pouch for your shards.

# Both seducer demons for Horde warlocks. Forever splits each city's
# Devourer of Souls into two branches you can both do: the succubus and the
# incubus (65xxx, the incubus quests Forever added). The two cities' versions
# exclude each other (Devourer of Souls 1507 and 1472, quests.json `excl`):
# the guide follows whichever one you take, Orgrimmar first because the Horde
# leveling route takes Gan'rul's (forever/horde/04-the-barrens, the
# succubus); once you hold or finished one, the other city's steps show "No
# longer offered". Accepts and turn-ins you already did tick off.
# Order: each city binds the succubus first and then sends you on the
# incubus errand that needs more travel or levels (the scarf from level 25-26
# mobs in Ashenvale; Isaac in Ratchet, past the Undercity on the way from the
# Wetlands), so a level 20-22 warlock gets the succubus without waiting.
# Orgrimmar (1507 from Gan'rul Bloodeye to Cazul):
# - succubus: Blind Cazul (1508) to Zankaja, News of Dogran (1509, 1510) to
#   Gazrog at the Crossroads and Ken'zigla at Malaka'jin in Stonetalon,
#   Ken'zigla's Draught (1511) to Grunt Logmar at Camp Taurajo, Dogran's
#   Captivity (1515) to Grunt Dogran in the quilboar camp, Love's Gift (1512)
#   back to Gan'rul and The Binding (1513, Dogran's Pendant on the circle in
#   Neeru Fireblade's tent);
# - incubus: Love Hurts (65601) to Magar, Wish You Were Here (65610, the
#   Withered Scarf from the Fallen Sky Lake bog beasts in Ashenvale) and The
#   Binding (65604) at the same circle.
# Undercity (1472 from Carendin Halgar to Godrick Farsan):
# - succubus: Hearts of the Pure (1476: Dalin Forgewright in Silverpine,
#   Corma Villard in the Wetlands) and The Binding (1474, the Pure Hearts on
#   the circle below Carendin);
# - incubus: Hearts of the Lovers (65593: Avelina Lilly at Ambermill,
#   Silverpine, and Isaac Pearson in Ratchet) and The Binding (65597).
# Forever renamed Comar Villard to Corma Villard (Forever's quest page for
# 1476 and its npc page for 5683); our data keeps the old names for the npc
# (5683) and the heart (6313), same spawn: the Wetlands end of the Thandol
# Span. Hearts of the Lovers lists Avelina's Heart first and Isaac's Heart
# second (corrections.json 65593, #412).
# Each Binding pays a Small Soul Pouch (quests.json 1513, 1474, 65604, 65597).
# The incubus spell is Summon Incubus (713) in Forever's client tables; the
# quest data does not name it, the Classic quest pages do.
# Drops: Withered Scarf about one in twenty from the Shadethicket Stone Movers
# and Bark Rippers (25-26; items.json 5%); the four hearts every time
# (Dalin and Corma: 100%; Avelina and Isaac: the only droppers). Dalin,
# Corma, Avelina and Isaac are friendly to the Alliance: attacking them can
# flag you for PvP (quest notes).
# Lint warns that 1472, 1476, 1474, 65593 and 65597 are not offered once 1507
# is taken: the two cities' versions in one guide, kept visible, not hidden.
# The binding items of the incubus quests (Withered Scarf, Lovers' Hearts)
# have two ids each in items.json and none in the server tables we have, so
# those steps name the item in the tip and carry no `use` goal.

step Devourer of Souls (Orgrimmar)
  tip At 20 Gan'rul Bloodeye, in the Cleft of Shadow under the Valley of Strength, sends you to Cazul a few steps away. Two trainers start these demons, Gan'rul here and Carendin Halgar in the Undercity, and you can take only one; this guide follows whichever Devourer of Souls you took. Cazul offers both of Orgrimmar's branches: take both.
  level 20
  accept 1507                         -- Gan'rul Bloodeye
  turnin 1507                         -- Cazul
  accept 1508                         -- the succubus
  accept 65601                        -- the incubus

step Zankaja
  tip Zankaja lives in a hut up on the cliffs on the west side of the city, above the Valley of Strength: climb the wind rider tower, cross the bridge at its top to the west and turn right off it. She sends you to the Crossroads.
  turnin 1508                         -- Zankaja
  accept 1509

step Magar
  tip Magar keeps Magar's Cloth Goods on the main street east of the Cleft of Shadow. He asks you to look for his mate Krilge in Ashenvale.
  turnin 65601                        -- Magar
  accept 65610

step Gazrog
  zone The Barrens
  tip Gazrog waits in front of the inn at the Crossroads. He sends you on to Ken'zigla at Malaka'jin, in Stonetalon Mountains.
  turnin 1509                         -- Gazrog
  accept 1510

step Ken'zigla
  zone Stonetalon Mountains
  tip Take the road west from the Crossroads into Stonetalon Mountains and, just past the border, the faint trail up to the left (south): Malaka'jin cannot be reached from the main road. Ken'zigla hands you her draught for Grunt Logmar.
  turnin 1510                         -- Ken'zigla, Malaka'jin
  accept 1511

step Grunt Dogran
  zone The Barrens
  tip Grunt Logmar stands at Camp Taurajo, south down the road from the Crossroads. He sends you north to the quilboar camp where Dogran is held: the camp with two huts side by side, north-west of a decoy camp whose huts stand apart. A rare level 22 elite quilboar sometimes guards the huts: send your voidwalker in, sacrifice it if you must, and talk to Dogran. He gives you a pendant for Gan'rul. Keep it.
  turnin 1511                         -- Grunt Logmar, Camp Taurajo
  accept 1515
  turnin 1515                         -- Grunt Dogran
  accept 1512

step The Binding: succubus (Orgrimmar)
  zone Orgrimmar
  tip Back to Gan'rul with the pendant. He hands you Dogran's Pendant: take it across the Cleft of Shadow to Neeru Fireblade's tent, stand on the purple circle and use it. Summon your voidwalker first and let it tank: the succubus (level 20, not elite) charms and lashes; keep your damage over time on her. If she wins, use the pendant again. Keep the pendant: Gan'rul takes it back.
  turnin 1512                         -- Gan'rul Bloodeye
  accept 1513
  use 6626 @49.4,50.0                 -- Dogran's Pendant, on the circle in Neeru's tent
  kill 5677 quest 1513.1              -- Summoned Succubus
  turnin 1513                         -- Gan'rul Bloodeye: Summon Succubus

step Fallen Sky Lake
  zone Ashenvale
  tip Fallen Sky Lake lies in southern Ashenvale, south-west of Splintertree Post. The Shadethicket Stone Movers and Bark Rippers (level 25-26) around the lake drop the Withered Scarf about one time in twenty, and the lone Shadethicket Oracle (30) can drop it too: plan on a good number of kills, so come at 25 or later (Forever made this quest level 27); with the succubus already bound you can leave it for your 20s leveling in Ashenvale. They respawn in five minutes.
  collect 190232 quest 65610.1        -- Withered Scarf

step The Binding: incubus (Orgrimmar)
  zone Orgrimmar
  tip Back to Gan'rul with the scarf, then use the Withered Scarf on the same circle in Neeru's tent and defeat the incubus it calls (level 20, not elite) with your voidwalker tanking. Keep the scarf: Gan'rul takes it back.
  turnin 65610                        -- Gan'rul Bloodeye
  accept 65604
  kill 185335 quest 65604.1           -- Summoned Incubus, at the circle in Neeru's tent
  turnin 65604                        -- Gan'rul Bloodeye: Summon Incubus

step Devourer of Souls (Undercity)
  zone Undercity
  tip The Undercity's version, for warlocks who took Carendin Halgar's Devourer of Souls instead of Gan'rul's. At 20 Carendin, in the Magic Quarter, sends you to Godrick Farsan close by. Godrick shows you an image of each quarry and offers both branches: take both.
  level 20
  accept 1472                         -- Carendin Halgar
  turnin 1472                         -- Godrick Farsan
  accept 1476                         -- the succubus
  accept 65593                        -- the incubus

step Silverpine hearts
  zone Silverpine Forest
  tip Avelina Lilly (level 22) works as a tailor for the Dalaran wizards at Ambermill, in eastern Silverpine: the wizards around her are hostile. Dalin Forgewright (level 20, not elite) patrols near the Greymane Wall in the far south. Both are Alliance-friendly humans: attacking them can flag you for PvP. Each drops her or his heart.
  collect 190179 quest 65593.1        -- Avelina's Heart
  collect 6312 quest 1476.1           -- Dalin's Heart

step Corma Villard
  zone Wetlands
  tip Corma Villard (level 22, not elite; Comar in older records) wanders the north of the Wetlands just past the Thandol Span, to the right as you come off the bridge. From the Undercity head through Hillsbrad and Arathi Highlands, where the mobs are 30 and up. Attacking her flags you for PvP.
  collect 6313 quest 1476.2           -- Corma's Heart

step The Binding: succubus (Undercity)
  zone Undercity
  tip Back to Carendin with Dalin's and Corma's hearts. He hands you the Pure Hearts: go down to the summoning circle below him, stand on it and use them. Summon your voidwalker first and keep the fight on the circle, or the guards may kill her and the kill does not count. If she wins, use the hearts again; keep them, Carendin takes them back.
  turnin 1476                         -- Carendin Halgar
  accept 1474
  use 6286 @86.6,27.1                 -- Pure Hearts, on the circle below Carendin
  kill 5677 quest 1474.1              -- Summoned Succubus
  turnin 1474                         -- Carendin Halgar: Summon Succubus

step Isaac Pearson
  zone The Barrens
  tip Isaac Pearson (level 22) works in Ratchet, on the Barrens coast, at one of two spots in town: take the zeppelin to Durotar and head south, or fly from Orgrimmar. He is an Alliance-friendly human: attacking him can flag you for PvP.
  collect 190180 quest 65593.2        -- Isaac's Heart

step The Binding: incubus (Undercity)
  zone Undercity
  tip Back to Carendin with the lovers' hearts, then place the Lovers' Hearts on the same circle and defeat the incubus they call (level 20, not elite; it can charm you). Keep the hearts: Carendin takes them back.
  turnin 65593                        -- Carendin Halgar
  accept 65597
  kill 185335 quest 65597.1           -- Summoned Incubus, at the circle below Carendin
  turnin 65597                        -- Carendin Halgar: Summon Incubus
